OL,3,GNEWSACarer jailed after stealing #26k
OL,4,Afrom patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FA carer who stole more than #26,000
OL,7,Ffrom two adults with learning
OL,8,Fdifficulties has been jailed.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said Michelle
OL,11,FFlintoff, 50, was the team leader of a
OL,12,Fhome in Newark, providing
OL,13,Fround-the-clock care to the two adults
OL,14,Fand was also responsible for managing
OL,15,Ftheir finances.
OL,17,FBetween 2020 and 2025, she fraudulently
OL,18,Ftook #26,299 from the three accounts
OL,19,Ffor her own benefit, and made a number
OL,20,Fof purchases through Amazon and high
OL,21,Fstreet retailers, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
