OL,3,GNEWSACarer jailed after stealing #26k
OL,4,Afrom patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday Flintoff, of Clarks Lane,
OL,7,FNewark, was sentenced to two years and
OL,8,Fsix months in prison, after pleading
OL,9,Fguilty to three counts of fraud by
OL,10,Fabuse of position.
